Package: agecraft
Type: Package
Title: Age Calculation and Grouping
Version: 0.1.0.9014
Authors@R: person(
    "Russ", "Jones",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "RussJones007@gmail.com",
    comment = NULL
  )
Description: Calculate calendar and elapsed ages from dates and date-times,
    retaining fractional precision with explicit time units. Represent age ranges
    as intervals with fractional boundaries and optional names, classify ages
    into ordered categories, and compare age ranges. Includes reusable age-group
    definitions and explicit unit conversion.
